  "releaseNotes": "# [v1.2.0-pre.3.fe3f4dfc](https://github.com/Fresa/Library.Net.ContinuousDelivery/compare/b45cc931e76a909e0607c090111b0c674cbbc4e6...fe3f4dfcffa3b83188107a3775b04d3234fb5705) (2026-07-07)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* release ref must be an identifier of the pre-release version or a squash would not generate a unique ID ([f2dc625](https://github.com/Fresa/Library.Net.ContinuousDelivery/commit/f2dc6256c1cfcb1509ca77afa8588a7c7a7d5eb1))\n* use dot separated release version identifiers for pre-releases so the commit counter is compared numerically ([fe3f4df](https://github.com/Fresa/Library.Net.ContinuousDelivery/commit/fe3f4dfcffa3b83188107a3775b04d3234fb5705))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* include number of commits in pre-release versions to make it order lexicographical. Also separate commit hash with plus to identify as a build identifier ([1538714](https://github.com/Fresa/Library.Net.ContinuousDelivery/commit/15387142e41a866084ed6f49d45f9368f67dcbbb))",
